      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "kb-text",
              "name": "kbText",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# TechNova Support Knowledge Base\n\n## Shipping\nStandard shipping takes 3-5 business days inside Bangladesh and 7-14 business days internationally. Express shipping takes 1-2 business days and costs 350 BDT. Orders placed after 6 PM are processed the next business day. Tracking links are emailed within 24 hours of dispatch.\n\n## Returns and Refunds\nCustomers may return any unused item within 30 days of delivery for a full refund. The item must be in its original packaging. Refunds are issued to the original payment method within 5-7 business days after the returned item reaches our warehouse. Sale items and gift cards are final sale and cannot be returned. Damaged or defective items can be returned at any time within the 12-month warranty window and we cover the return shipping cost.\n\n## Warranty\nAll hardware carries a 12-month limited warranty covering manufacturing defects. The warranty does not cover water damage, physical damage from drops, or unauthorised repairs. A warranty claim needs the order number and a photo of the defect.\n\n## Billing and Subscriptions\nThe Starter plan is 9 USD per month, Growth is 29 USD per month and Business is 99 USD per month. Annual billing gives two months free. Customers can upgrade at any time and the change is prorated. Downgrades take effect at the start of the next billing cycle. Subscriptions can be cancelled any time from Settings then Billing then Cancel Plan. We do not offer partial-month refunds on cancellation, but access continues until the end of the paid period. Invoices can be downloaded from Settings then Billing then Invoices.\n\n## Account and Login\nTo reset a password, use the Forgot Password link on the login page. The reset link expires after 60 minutes. Two-factor authentication can be enabled in Settings then Security. If a customer has lost access to their 2FA device, support must verify identity with the last invoice number before disabling 2FA.\n\n## Support Hours and Escalation\nSupport is available Sunday to Thursday, 9 AM to 6 PM Bangladesh Standard Time. Priority support with a 4-hour response target is included on the Business plan. Anything involving a chargeback, a legal complaint, a data deletion request or an outage affecting many customers must be escalated to a human agent immediately."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
